{"id":"ptc2a2lphb9h1yks45wmq5p05","title":"Empa 发明新型液芯纤维用于长效防蚊蚊帐","originalTitle":"A net to protect against the world's deadliest animal—the mosquito","summary":"Empa 研究团队开发了一种新型液芯纤维，含有新型杀虫剂，可用于生产长效防蚊蚊帐。该纤维中的杀虫剂可缓慢释放，预计效果可持续三年，有望解决蚊媒疾病防控难题，特别是针对对传统杀虫剂产生抗性的疟疾传播蚊子。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-net-world-deadliest-animal-mosquito.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T18:20:04.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T18:28:21.840Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T18:28:21.840Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["研究成果"],"score":38,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"ac46529f-a25a-4ff9-9616-bf285e9ef3a7","title":"Empa新型液芯纤维或实现长效防蚊蚊帐"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"ac46529f-a25a-4ff9-9616-bf285e9ef3a7","title":"Empa新型液芯纤维或实现长效防蚊蚊帐"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fleWvE_zwq9Q","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}